                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNG ZUR INDUKTIVEN ERHITZUNG VON RAUCHBAREM MATERIAL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL DE CHAUFFAGE INDUCTIF DE MATIÈRE À FUMER</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">APPARATUS FOR INDUCTIVE HEATING OF SMOKABLE MATERIAL</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed is an article (1, 2) for use with apparatus for heating smokable material to volatilise at least one component of the smokable material. The article (1, 2) comprises smokable material (30), and a film defining a closed circuit (10a-10f) of heating material (10). The heating material (10) is heatable by penetration with a varying magnetic field to heat the smokable material (30). Also disclosed is apparatus (100, 200) for heating smokable material to volatilise at least one component of the smokable material. The apparatus (100, 200) comprises a magnetic field generator (120) for generating a varying magnetic field for use in heating the smokable material. The magnetic field generator (120) comprises a film defining a coil (50, 60, 70) of electrically conductive material, and a device (123) for passing a varying electrical current through the coil (50, 60, 70).</p>
            </abstract>
